---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import Todo from "@/components/Todo.astro";
import { site } from "@/config/site";

const operator = site.legalName || site.name;
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms governing the use of chalybesteel.com, including the status of technical information, quotations and intellectual property."
  updated="11 November 2026"
>
  {!site.legalName && (
    <p>
      <Todo note="add legal entity name, registered address and governing law before relying on these terms" />
    </p>
  )}

  <h2>About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of chalybesteel.com (the "website"), operated by {operator}
    ("Chalybe Steel", "we", "us"). By using the website you accept these terms. If you do not accept
    them, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>Information on this website</h2>
  <p>
    Product descriptions, size tables, grade data and other technical information are provided for
    general reference only. They are indicative and may not reflect the current edition of API 5CT
    or other standards. The specification of any supply is determined solely by the purchase order
    and the documents agreed with us in writing.
  </p>
  <p>
    While we take care to keep the website accurate, we make no warranty that the information is
    complete, current or free of errors, and it should not be relied on for engineering design
    without independent verification.
  </p>

  <h2>Quotations and orders</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website is an offer to sell. Submitting an enquiry or request for quotation does
    not create a contract. Any supply is subject to a written quotation and order confirmation, and
    to the terms and conditions stated in them.
  </p>

  <h2>Trademarks and intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The Chalybe Steel name, logo, website design and content are our property or used with
    permission. You may view and print pages for your own business use, but may not copy, reproduce
    or distribute website content for other purposes without our written consent.
  </p>
  <p>
    API and API 5CT are trademarks of the American Petroleum Institute. Chalybe Steel is a trading
    company and is not an API-licensed manufacturer. Other standards and names referred to on this
    website belong to their respective owners, and their mention does not imply endorsement or
    affiliation.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    You must not use the website in a way that is unlawful, that interferes with its operation or
    security, or that sends unsolicited or automated submissions.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss arising from the use of, or
    reliance on, information on this website. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be
    limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>We are not responsible for the content of external websites linked from this website.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms at any time; the date above shows the latest version. Questions about
    these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
